Third-party components
----------------------
This repository does not vendor third-party source code. Components are fetched at build time from their
registries or pinned releases and keep their own licenses:

- Rust crates of the engine and CLI: see crates/THIRD_PARTY.md (all permissive; GPL is denied by deny.toml).
- Firmware: CMSIS 6 Core headers (Apache-2.0) and Unity (MIT), downloaded at configure time with pinned
  versions and sha256 checks; see firmware/README.md.
- EUC Studio app: npm packages and fonts, see app/THIRD_PARTY.md.

Binary releases include the full license texts of everything they bundle.

Trademarks
----------
Begode, Gotway and other brand and product names are trademarks of their respective owners. EUC Studio is an
independent project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any EUC manufacturer. Brand names
are used only to say which hardware a profile or firmware targets.

Stock firmware
--------------
EUC Studio does not include or redistribute any manufacturer's firmware. The `euc fetch` command downloads
official images from the manufacturer's public update server to the user's own machine and checks them against
pinned sha256 hashes.
